    "description": "Project 40.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADM401 · Assessment 4/4</span>\n<h2>Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13379 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADM401 · Đầu điểm 4/4</span>\n<h2>Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13379 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">40.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">3 Week</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO4,CLO5,CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Assignment 3: User Interface &amp; Prototype Design<br>Students will build on insights and outputs from assignments 1 and 2 to design the full user interface and create a high-fidelity interactive prototype of their application. The focus is on applying effective design practices to develop visually appealing, consistent, and functional interfaces that enhance user experience.<br>Students must submit a complete high-fidelity prototype via a shareable link with full, engaging interactions. Submission should also include persuasive promotional materials like poster,showcase portfolio or walkthrought video showcasing the app and its interface.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Students gain the ability to apply design practices to build high-fidelity prototypes<br>Refine UI for clarity and consistency<br>Demonstrate interactive functionality<br>Present the app effectively through persuasive visuals and promotional media.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Group assignment of 3–4 students, carried out in class and at home over 2 weeks.<br>Teams will present progress in stages, get feedback from the instructor, and update their work accordingly.<br>Students are required to use AI for heuristic usability evaluation. They must document AI feedback, compare it with learned UX principles, and update their design accordingly.<br>Students must document updates and manage different report versions as part of the submission.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
